# IEEE Student Branch — Environment Variables
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# EmailJS Configuration
# Get these values from https://www.emailjs.com/ after creating your account.
#
# Setup steps:
#  1. Create a free EmailJS account at https://www.emailjs.com/
#  2. Add an Email Service (Gmail recommended):
#       Dashboard → Email Services → Add New Service → Gmail
#  3. Create an Email Template:
#       Dashboard → Email Templates → Create New Template
#       Set "To Email": ieeestudentchapter@ist.srmtrichy.edu.in
#       Add these variables in the template body:
#         {{from_name}}, {{from_email}}, {{register_number}},
#         {{category}}, {{subject}}, {{message}}, {{reference_id}}
#  4. Copy and paste the values below.
#
# These VITE_ prefixed variables are safe to use in frontend code.
# The public key is NOT secret — it is designed to be used in browsers.
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

VITE_EMAILJS_SERVICE_ID=YOUR_SERVICE_ID
VITE_EMAILJS_TEMPLATE_ID=YOUR_TEMPLATE_ID
VITE_EMAILJS_PUBLIC_KEY=YOUR_PUBLIC_KEY

